This license covers the benchmark harness itself: the corpus pins, the oracle
builders, the grader, the runner, and the open arms (grep, repowise adapter,
cheburnexus-ts adapter code). It does not cover:

- the pinned third-party repositories under `corpus/` (each keeps its own
  upstream license — see `corpus.json` and CORPUS_NOTES.md for the license of
  every pinned repository);
- the Cheburnexus engine binary itself, which is closed-source and not
  distributed in this repository (see README.md, "Auditable, not
  rerunnable").
